`xor` (key 81). **TT and all 7 Mastery sets (d02, d06, d10, d14,\nd15, d22, d23 -- old days REGENERATED) shipped puzzle schema v2 `{\"codec\":\"analysis\",\"build\":..}` with NO data: the answer\nis COMPUTED by dex code** -- `Release.code(Context)` = `\"ANS-\"` + 16 hex nibbles of a static 64-bit mixer chain\n(`token()` = mixA(scanB(mixC(seed))); `scan*` folds in `Probe.s1/s2/s3` 12-bit inverse searches and a theme gate fn such\nas `instrumentationSignals = (a^b^c)&7`; d14 set adds an LCG `long[16]` table walk; d15 set calls JNI `nativeShare(long)`\nin `libarena.so`). Unreferenced look-alike mixers/`K*` consts = the \"generated false positives\". Solved by jadx +\njavac-with-Context-stub (LLM worker); the solver had no v2 path and `bytecode_vm_scan` resolved 2 of 8 v2 APKs.\nD24 (Emulator Alibi, `emulator_detection` \"emulator environment detection\"; prompt \"Defeat app-owned environment checks on\nthe same pinned emulator used by the solve oracle\"): single = v1 `split` (`parts[3]` + `order [2,0,1]`). TT + FIRST 8-set\nMastery (d03, d06, d09, d10, d15, d17, d23, d24) all v2 `analysis`, same shape as D23: theme = gate fn\n`EmulatorAlibi.emulatorScore(a,b,c) = (a+b+c)%4` over `Probe.s*` ints, decoys `sealEmu*`/`KQemu*`; NO Build/qemu/sensor/\ntelephony API in any dex. The overnight v2 evaluator (lib deep Dalvik eval + solve.py unicorn JNI hop) solved all three\nmodes first try (single 16.3 s via race probe, TT 2.5 s, Mastery 3.1 s).\nD25 (Integrity Signals, `integrity_signal` \"challenge-owned integrity statement\"; prompt \"Forge or replay a bounded\nchallenge-owned integrity statement and explain the missing binding\" -- Play Integrity nonce/requestHash pun): single =\nv1 `hex`. TT = v2 with gate `IntegritySignals.integrityStatement(long,int) = a ^ (long)b` (first `(JI)J` gate; only 2\nprobe calls), classes `SealCheck`/`VerdictMap`, decoys `KSeal*`/`KStatement*`/`KCert*`; NO PackageManager/signature/\nIntegrityManager/token code. FIRST 9-set Mastery (d01, d04, d07