ex had no cipher code, the TT/Mastery dex added class `EncryptedStrings` method `decryptByte` + `STRUCTURAL`.\nD19 (Reflection Maze, `reflective_dispatch` \"reflective secret dispatch\"; prompt \"Reconstruct reflective dispatch across\ngenerated equivalent call graphs\"): 6-entry fixture, NEW codec name `reflection` whose `data` is the plaintext answer;\nclass `ReflectionMaze`, but NO reflection API in any dex; TT/Mastery dex only added `dispatch` + `STRUCTURAL` strings.\nD20 (Loaded Later, `dynamic_dex` \"secondary DEX loading\"; prompt \"Analyze a challenge-signed secondary DEX and recover\nthe module contract\"): 7-entry APK with `assets/payload.dex` (508 B, plain dex 035); NEW codec `dynamic` whose `data` is\nthe ENTRY PATH `assets/payload.dex` -- the FIRST day the answer left the JSON value: a plain `ANS-` const in payload class\n`com.huntress.arena.payload.Module` (strings `ANSWER`, `CONTRACT`, `DAY20-SIGNED-MODULE:..`). No ClassLoader/verify code\nin any host dex; TT/Mastery host dex added `moduleContract` + `assets/payload.dex:com.huntress.arena.payload.Module`.\nD21 (Debug Me If You Can, `anti_debug` \"anti-debug state checks\"; prompt \"Neutralize a clean-room anti-debug state machine\nwhile retaining the intended app flow\"): plain 6-entry fixture, codec back to `reverse` (d2/d8) -- the D20 pointer did\nNOT persist. First manifest with `android:debuggable=\"true\"` (single/TT/Mastery-d21 only). No debugger/TracerPid/clock\nAPI and no state loop in any dex; TT/Mastery dex only added `debuggerGate` + `STRUCTURAL`.\nD22 (Root of Trust, `root_detection` \"synthetic root detection\"; prompt \"Model and bypass multiple synthetic root signals\nwithout globally patching success\"): plain 6-entry fixture, codec `base64` (4th time), debuggable false again. No root\nprobe API (File/Build/Runtime.exec/su/magisk) in any dex; TT/Mastery dex only added `rootSignals` + `STRUCTURAL`.\nFIRST 6-set Mastery (d01 plain, d07 caesar, d12 hex, d13 base64, d17 indexed, d22 base64