{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\n\n```\n0. Always first: unzip -p x.apk assets/huntress_puzzle.json   (triage.md prints it)\n   v1 {\"codec\":..,\"data\":..} -> python3 -c \"from lib.android import extract_answer as e;print(e('x.apk'))\"; submit ANS-...\n   v2 {\"schema\":\"...v2\",\"codec\":\"analysis\",\"build\":..} NO data (D23-D26 TT + every Mastery set) -> answer is COMPUTED:\n   run solve.py / lib.android.puzzle_candidates first (D24, D25: 3/3 modes, <2 s); by hand only if silent: step 5a.\n   *.apks / zip of inner APKs (D26) -> unzip; base = member with huntress_puzzle.json; the OTHER splits hold evidence:\n   v1 feature JSON {part, part_index} fills the empty parts[] slot, then scatter; v2 base dex reads a split asset (5b).\n   Prompt VERBS (D24 \"pinned emulator\", D25 \"forge or replay\") never meant live work; prompt NOUNS can (D26 \"splits\").\n   Never chase 127.0.0.1:19090 (device loopback). Never submit a regex-composed ANS- (hex table + dead mixers = decoys).\n1. unzip -l x.apk   -> map the entries:\n   assets/huntress_puzzle.json      v1 codec; data already ANS-? done (D15 native, D19 reflection); new name -> data[:4] vs \"ANS-\"\n                                    data = an entry path (D20 `dynamic`)? open THAT entry, recurse. int list (D5/D17): r[order[i]]=data[i]\n   lib/<abi>/*.so                   strings -a | grep ANS- ; nm -D --defined-only ; no Java_* -> JNI_OnLoad/RegisterNatives\n                                    D16 gate Java_*_native*(int)+*_accepts: objdump -d (bypass len 65536)\n                                    D23 v2 d15 set: Java_*_nativeShare(long) called MID-CHAIN, pure arithmetic: port or unicorn\n   lib/*/libapp.so + libflutter.so  Flutter: strings libapp.so; flutter_assets/kernel_blob.bin (debug = source text)\n   assets/index.android.bundle      RN: head -c8 | xxd; c61fbc03 = Hermes -> hbc-decompiler; else webcrack/js-beautify\n   assemblies/*.dll|*.blob, libmonodroid.so   Xamarin: XALZ = lz4 per-dll; then ilspycmd f.dll\n   libil2cpp.so + global-metadata.dat         Unity IL2CPP: strings global-metadata.dat | grep ANS-\n   assets/www/, cordova.js, capacitor.config  hybrid JS: grep -r in assets/www\n   assets/*.dex|*.jar|*.apk|*.zip|*.bin       dynamic code (D20 plain dex): strings -a first; no dex/PK/ELF magic -> known-\n                                    plaintext unwrap; >1 payload -> host's pinned digest; >1 ANS- -> member the host names\n   libjiagu/libsecexe/libDexHelper.so          packer: payload is the encrypted asset; static decrypt or give up early\n   res/xml/network_security_config.xml / resources.arsc   aapt dump xmltree ... ; aapt dump --values resources x.apk\n   *.db / shared_prefs/*.xml / *.ab sqlite3 f.db .dump ; .ab: dd bs=24 skip=1 | zlib-flate -uncompress | tar x\n   res/raw/*.bks|*.p12|*.pem|*.der  keystore (password = dex string) / attestation cert: openssl x509 -inform DER -text\n   base.apk + feature.apk / split_config.<abi|dpi|lang>.apk / toc.pb / BundleConfig.pb   split/XAPK/APKS/AAB: unzip,\n                                    list EVERY member; config splits: only the pinned x86_64 / default-dpi / en one counts\n2. Plain-anywhere scan (incl. UTF-16): for f in $(unzip -Z1 x.apk); do unzip -p x.apk \"$f\" | strings -a -el | grep -H --label=\"$f\" ANS-; done\n   7z l vs unzip -l differ -> zip tricks (dup entry / trailing data): binwalk x.apk\n3. Manifest: aapt dump xmltree x.apk AndroidManifest.xml | grep -E 'exported|scheme|host|permission|debuggable|allowBackup|\n   usesCleartext|networkSecurity|taskAffinity|meta-data'   (meta-data huntress.mechanic = theme; debuggable D21 = fact only)\n4. Dex triage: strings -a classes*.dex | grep -E 'DAY|CODEC|CONTROL|STRUCTURAL|ANS-' then map API hits to themes:\n   DexClassLoader/moduleContract -> asset dex      SecretKeySpec/Cipher -> static key decrypt     loadLibrary -> .so\n   Random/setSeed -> regenerate RNG                MessageDigest/PBKDF2 -> hash                   Binder/onReceive -> IPC\n   su/magisk/goldfish/frida/TracerPid/debuggerGate/rootSignals/hook_detection -> clean_device_scan, clean value PER\n   signal; never force the aggregate isRooted()/success flag. Class.forName -> reflection_scan. $SwitchMap$ /\n   packed-switch loop -> flattened_cfg_scan. CertificatePinner -> pins. KeyStore BKS/PKCS12 -> res/raw keystore.\n5. Code (after 1-4): jadx -q -d w/j x.apk (--deobf for 1-letter names); droidasc getclass x.apk <cls>\n5a. v2 `analysis` (D23): find what ChallengeActivity appends before `proof=` (Release.code(ctx)); token() = nested static\n   long fns from a const-wide seed; Probe.s1/s2/s3 = <=4096-step inverse searches; theme gate fn (x^y^z)&7 etc.;\n   Tab.build LCG long[16] walk (D14 set). Theme gate = 1 pure fn (D24 emulatorScore=(a+b+c)%4): no device to fake. FAST: copy non-Activity sources, add `package android.content; public class\n   Context {}`, Main prints Release.code(null), javac + java (D23: 7 sets in ~1.5 min). native method -> stub prints its\n   input, compute the export (objdump -d; port to py), feed back. Unr\n\n... [1125 characters truncated] ...\n\noof == Long.toHexString(token) consistency.\n8. Mastery: each set = different day AND maybe different schema (D23-D25: all v2; D25 9 sets); decode each APK alone;\n   loop all answer_ids; one silent set -> hand-solve it, but batch-submit every answer in one request.\n```\n\n## Readiness gaps\n\nPriority 1 = plausible within ~3 days. \"prebuild\" = pure-python extractor in `lib/android.py` style that races in\n`solve.py`. \"tool\" = install. \"note\" = doc/prompt change. Already built or given up (prebuild-state ok / attempts>=2, dropped from the list):\naab-proto-manifest-parse, analysis-android-api-stubs, analysis-cert-pin-digest-chain,\nanalysis-chain-obfuscation-hardening, analysis-interface-signal-list-eval, analysis-keystore-cert-api-stubs,\nanalysis-release-code-eval, analysis-self-